## Note on Linux

The **Linux kernel** is licensed under **GPLv2 only** (not MIT, not Apache-2.0).
That is a different license family (copyleft).

FSOT Reality OS intentionally uses the **MIT OR Apache-2.0** dual license common
in the Rust ecosystem so the kernel crates, host tools, and documentation can be
combined with most permissive and many dual-licensed dependencies without forcing
GPLv2 on downstream users.

If a future Linux-kernel module or out-of-tree driver is published under GPLv2
to match Linux, that component will carry its own explicit GPLv2 notice.
